<tbx xmlns="urn:iso:std:iso:30042:ed-2" type="TBX-Basic" style="dca" xml:lang="de">
 <tbxHeader>
  <fileDesc>
   <titleStmt>
    <title>Gleichlaut SL termbase 06.10.2026 (DE-FR-IT)</title>
   </titleStmt>
   <sourceDesc>
    <p>Mined by Gleichlaut (no model) from the 1688 limitation texts of the BAG Spezialitätenliste, public ePL FHIR feed 06.10.2026: per German term, the French / Italian n-gram most associated with it in the limitations whose German contains it. preferredTerm = the register's dominant rendering; admittedTerm = a minority variant the register also uses. Counts are limitations. Unreviewed: check before adopting.</p>
   </sourceDesc>
  </fileDesc>
 </tbxHeader>
